 "remarks": "SUNNY 3 BEDROOM, 2 BATH END UNIT IN A COVETED CORNER OF PUTNAM PARK. Tucked away in a delightful, secluded courtyard, this spacious home has 3 exposures, flexible floor plan, 1-level living on 2nd floor, and wide open views of lush lawns, gardens & greenery. Living Room with balcony facing courtyard could be a Living/Dining Room. The 3rd Bedroom could be a Family Room, Home Office or Formal Dining Room, as currently used. Master Bedroom has walk-in closet & ensuite Bath w/stall shower. Hardwood floors, new windows, crown molding. On 12 landscaped acres in a pet-friendly complex in prime central Greenwich. Onsite parking; garage rental $85/mo. Near Whole Foods, just blocks to Greenwich Ave, train, restaurants, schools. Monthly maintenance partly tax deductible & includes gas heat/hot water.",
